5,1,1,talk,Mio,,I need to know what we can actually count on coming in before we set a figure.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,The evenings feel hesitant lately. I want to understand why people are hesitating.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Takumi,,It feels like the same dozen faces are doing everything. I want to see the numbers.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I need to know what the bookkeeping job really costs in time before we commit.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I worry that making things visible will break the easy way newcomers drift in.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Toshio, if the job is too heavy, who takes it next year?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mio, I think the hesitation is about commitment, not just cost.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Jonathan, commitment is easy when you are already there. It is hard for others.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Mio, I am looking at the hours. It is not just money, it is chasing.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Takumi, I agree. But if we fix it, everyone sees the fix.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,I will check the ledger to see where the money actually goes.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will look at the taster forms to see why people don't join.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I will check the sign-in sheets to see who is actually showing up.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will review the outgoing treasurer's logged hours to see the workload.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I will look at the bank statements to see how renewals are handled.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,"Also, I will check the bank statements to see the cash flow.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,And I will look at the weekday turnout to see the trend.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Takumi,,I will also check the rota against the attendance record.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I will also check the sign-up records for mid-year joiners.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I will also check the minute books from the named-grade years.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
