35,2,1,talk,Mio,,"The ledger shows seventy percent of costs are fixed, like hall hire.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,The taster forms say people are scared of a whole-year commitment.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Takumi,,A quarter of members do two-thirds of the work. It is very uneven.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Toshio,,Chasing individual payments took six hours a month. Yearly collection took one.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Kenji,,The bank statements show a third of renewals needed reminders. It is messy.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Toshio, six hours a month is too much for one person.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mio, if we charge per event, we might lose the quiet ones.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Jonathan, the quiet ones are already gone. The active ones are burning out.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Mio, yes, the administrative burden is the real killer here.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Takumi, I worry that highlighting the unevenness will make people feel judged.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,"I think a flat fee is simplest, but the fixed costs are high.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I prefer a base fee, but I am worried about the hesitation.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"I want to reward the active members, but I don't want to punish the quiet ones.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Toshio,,I am leaning towards a structure that minimizes chasing.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Kenji,,I want to keep the door open for newcomers without making it complicated.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mio,,"@Kenji, a flat fee is the easiest for newcomers to understand.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mio, but it might be too much for someone who only comes twice.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Mio, it is fair if the active members are subsidizing the quiet ones.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Mio, a flat fee means one collection. That saves hours of work.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Kenji,,"@Mio, I agree. Simplicity is key for keeping the vibe easy.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
