60,3,1,talk,Mio,,"Option A is a flat annual fee. Simple, but high for low-attendance members.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,Option B is tiered. It might scare off the hesitant newcomers.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Takumi,,Option C is activity-based. It rewards attendance but adds administrative chaos.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Toshio,,Option A minimizes the chasing. Option C maximizes it.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Kenji,,Option B feels like it creates walls. Option A feels like a community.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Mio,,"@Toshio, I agree. The administrative burden of C is too high.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mio, but A might be too expensive for the quiet members.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Jonathan, the quiet members are already paying the same as the active ones.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Mio, yes, and the ledger shows fixed costs are high anyway.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Mio, I think A is the best for keeping things simple and open.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Mio,,I am leaning towards A. It is the most sustainable for the treasurer.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I am hesitant about A, but B seems worse for newcomers.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Takumi,,I am okay with A if we acknowledge the subsidy from active members.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Toshio,,I am voting for A. The time savings are significant.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Kenji,,I am voting for A. It keeps the door open and the process simple.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Mio,,"@Jonathan, I understand your worry, but A is the only one that works.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mio, I suppose so. I will go with A.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Mio, I agree. Let's keep it simple.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Mio, agreed.","{""words"":2,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Kenji,,"@Mio, yes, let's do it.","{""words"":5,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
